---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact the Oropis desk.">
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Open line</p>
    <h1>Contact the desk</h1>
    <p>Tips, corrections, and coverage questions are welcome. We read everything; we cannot always reply to everything.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap narrow prose">
    <h2>General and tips</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:abhishek.shinde@oropis.com">abhishek.shinde@oropis.com</a>. For sensitive information, say so in the first line and we will handle it carefully.</p>
    <p>You can also reach the desk on X at <a href="https://x.com/OropisHQ" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">@OropisHQ</a>. DMs are open.</p>

    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>Send corrections to <a href="mailto:abhishek.shinde@oropis.com">abhishek.shinde@oropis.com</a> with the article URL and the specific claim that needs review. See the <a href="/corrections/">corrections policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>What to include</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Links to primary sources, not screenshots of someone else's summary.</li>
      <li>The lab, company, model, robot, and date the information concerns.</li>
      <li>Whether the information is public or provided confidentially.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
